  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Tsucora Kalashtar</h2>\n<p>The tsucora are the quori of classic nightmares, feeding on terror. If you have this quori ancestry, you can choose one of the following paths.</p>\n<h3>Tsucora Intimidator</h3>\n<p>You become trained in intimidation (or another skill if you were already trained in intimidation) and gain the @Compendium[pf2e.feats-srd.xQMz6eDgX75WX2ce]{Intimidating Glare} feat. When you use the @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} action, you can instead bend the target's mind to inspire fear. If you do so, Demoralize gains the mental trait rather than the visual trait.  </p>"
    },
